# Repository-wide line-ending policy: LF everywhere, on every platform.
# The project is developed and gated on Linux; the bash gate, Python
# sources, and text fixtures must never acquire CRLF (bash chokes on \r,
# and diffs/hashes stay byte-identical across platforms). Without this
# file a Windows clone depends on each machine's core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
